      "content": "exactly. it's just a void. and the more i try to stay \"resilient\" or \"positive,\" the more it feels like i'm just lying to myself. if the investment is already gone, then trying to keep going just feels like throwing good money after bad. isn't it more logical to just... stop? to just accept the loss and cut ties with the whole thing?",
